# The registry is derived, never committed, so it is not part of the image: the
# Dockerfile creates an empty seed with `Store('/app/seed.db')` and `mi ingest`
# populates it. Excluding it here also keeps the ~9 MB (plus ~340 MB of backups
# and pre-migration snapshots) out of the build context on every build.
